# Bear Trap: "Flash" and "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: It deals 3 damage to target creature." Bot1 holds its four
# Moxen until turn 2, when Bot2 casts Hill Giant: with the Giant still on the stack Bot1 flashes Bear Trap in with Mox Jet,
# an artifact, which is not a creature and so has no summoning sickness (CR 302.6 applies to creatures only) - it
# is activated the same turn. The ability is refused at Bot2's Mox Jet (not a creature), then with exactly {3} paid it
# deals 3 to the Giant (3/3), which dies, the Trap sacrificed as a cost.

